{"lyrics":"[주스 월드, 슈가, 방탄소년단 \"Girl Of My Dreams\" 가사]\n[Intro: Juice WRLD & Ally Lotti]\n[00:00.34]You gotta stay here for this\n[00:05.30]I do\n[00:05.74]I love you\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[00:12.92]The girl of my dreams, but I ain't fallin' asleep\n[00:16.12]Think both of your legs gone, the way you fallin' for me\n[00:19.34]The same way that the rain falls\n[00:21.26]I ain't gon' lie, you got it all, all, all, all, all of me\n[Verse 1: Juice WRLD]\n[00:28.54]Uh, love's all of you, like I'm John Legend or somethin'\n[00:32.44]Better save some room, for my heart, it's a big one\n[00:35.94]I'ma give it to you, ain't no better mood than you\n[00:39.08]Really helped me find my groove\n[00:40.72]Fake hoes come in by the pool\n[00:42.50]Real ones, there's barely a few\n[00:43.84]But somehow I found you\n[00:45.92]Harmony when I'm around you\n[00:47.62]Paradise when I'm around you (I'm around you)\n[00:49.80]These feelings brand new (Feelings brand new)\n[00:51.70]Me no fool, me just need yo' all\n[00:54.28]A million miles, you would walk for me\n[00:57.84]All four oceans, you would cross for me\n[01:00.82]Stop sippin' purple potion (For you, babe)\n[01:04.72]For you (Babe), keep it true, babe\n[01:08.00]If I ever try to leave, you'll be stalkin' me\n[01:11.40]Won't let any other woman come and talk to me\n[01:14.74]I'd do the same thing if you leave, honestly\n[01:17.38]Or I would take your life away\n[Bridge: Juice WRLD]\n[01:18.64]Ah, ah, ah, ah-ah\n[01:18.92]Ah, ah, ah, ah-ah\n[01:19.20]Ah, ah, ah, ah, ah-ah\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[01:19.56]The girl of my dreams, but I ain't fallin' asleep\n[01:20.74]Think both of your legs gone, the way you fallin' for me\n[01:22.02]The same way that the rain falls\n[01:23.06]I ain't gon' lie, you got it all, all, all, all, all of me\n[01:27.66]The girl of my dreams, but I ain't fallin' asleep\n[01:36.24]Think both of your legs gone, the way you fallin' for me\n[01:37.72]The same way that the rain falls\n[01:38.48]I ain't gon' lie, 